<urn:sha256:3c59453e863b50d3043744b1bd517523e8d430498e78dd5f86df0c7be6b1f11f> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The ledger is a workspace member of the product-cli repo and builds its materialized view on the same product-core graph infrastructure the ddd tool reuses; the .decisions/ files remain the source of truth with the index rebuildable, and .product/ is neither replaced nor consumed." .
