<urn:sha256:5034f2a98c2e290e290caa71bf79f3d68ef1112a5ee46eef5ad47db4649144f3> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The judgment-actor gap closes as verify class L010 in a spec v1.1 amendment: a judgment whose actor resolves to a model or CI identity fails the gate. Additive and stricter, shipped with a migration note stating that existing stores may newly fail and that this is the point; the exactly-nine class contract becomes exactly-ten everywhere it is asserted, including the closed-enum count test." .
