<urn:sha256:60c40bd47192e3e8ad99e0d08bdd7998561757ae424eb666ef7f14ef464ad73a> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Revise against an explicitly stated parent that is no longer the latest version is a refusal naming L3, never a quiet fork or a merge; the log's single-writer assumption is stated at the one place it bites, so per-decision merge arrives at L3 against a refusal, not against silent divergence." .
