<urn:sha256:db533d1bf931164969445d87819fada9ecceaec88d77c267d01f70a74dfcb6fa> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:ledger-design> .
<urn:sha256:db533d1bf931164969445d87819fada9ecceaec88d77c267d01f70a74dfcb6fa> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The RDF index is derived from the log by a byte-deterministic emission that reads nothing but the log, so deleting .decisions/index/ and rebuilding reproduces identical bytes; the rebuild comparison runs in CI, making the disposability of the index a tested property rather than a design intention." .
