<urn:sha256:f72357e05ac4ad508d3affc9f7b44a06ae66c6770e83fc277008ce9d7369e826> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:ledger-design> .
<urn:sha256:f72357e05ac4ad508d3affc9f7b44a06ae66c6770e83fc277008ce9d7369e826> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A set's tolerance is a floor and a version may override it only upward, so a below-floor state is unconstructible rather than policed; the effective tier is hashed content via the floor pinned at version creation, and raising a set's floor strands every member below it until re-accepted at the new floor." .
